  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat the oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "2. Slice the portuguese bread into thin rounds.",
    "3. In a bowl, mix together ricotta cheese, roast garlic, cumin seeds, coriander powder, and garam masala.",
